                "x": -200,
                "y": 1060
            },
            "size": {
                "width": 840,
                "height": 200
            },
            "config": {
                "text": "A single main game screen. At the top: level, moves, and a score progress bar.\nBelow that: a panel displaying four tasks.\nBelow that: an input area for forming a word from letter tiles, featuring \"Apply\" and \"Cancel\" (X) buttons.\nBelow that: an area containing the letter tiles used to form the word.\nBelow that: a booster panel.\n\nCasual style. No special effects; static visuals only. Portrait orientation (9:16 aspect ratio).",
                "sourceName": ""
            },
