            "config": {
                "text": "2D illustration of an anthropomorphic capybara airship captain, matching the detailed anime-influenced style of a casual game character. He is tall, slim, masculine, with a warm, friendly, and approachable personality, inspired by a kind aviator. He has ruffled fur, warm and kind eyes, and a genuine, welcoming smile. He wears a slightly rumpled steampunk aviator outfit: a worn brown leather flight jacket with visible wrinkles, a striped pilot scarf, an unbuttoned shirt, faded trousers, and scuffed leather boots. He wears a captain's hat slightly askew with aviator goggles resting on the brim. He holds a tarnished brass compass in one hand and leans on a heavy brass spyglass or a scratched wooden cane in the other. Relaxed but open posture, inviting and unbothered. Floating alphabet letters around him. Soft shading, slightly gritty texture, muted warm colors, soft gradient background. High resolution, character design, game asset, front view, eye-level, 4k.",
                "sourceName": ""
