            },
            "config": {
                "text": "A masterpiece, ultra-detailed anime illustration of a 25-year-old young woman. She has long light peach-orange hair styled in twin tails with black hair bows, a prominent ahoge (cowlick), and large expressive red eyes with detailed specular highlights. She is wearing a highly detailed white pinstripe button-up shirt with rolled-up sleeves, a bright red necktie, and brown armbands. Her lower body features brown knickerbocker-style shorts, a brown leather belt, and hanging suspender straps, paired with black thigh-high socks. She is standing confidently with her hands on her hips. The art style is a modern high-quality anime illustration, featuring soft shading, vibrant colors, intricate fabric textures, realistic clothing folds, cinematic lighting, and a soft glow. Perfect anatomy, 8k resolution, isolated on a pure white background.",
